So I gave him the vegetables and rice I prepared.

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,580
Then he gave my junior sister a survival coin

6
00:00:16,980 --> 00:00:18,260
Drink a chef's work permit

7
00:00:19,870 --> 00:00:21,830
He said that survivors with work permits

8
00:00:22,030 --> 00:00:24,750
Don’t worry, you can refuse a newbie dungeon mission.

9
00:00:24,990 --> 00:00:26,550
The little one will definitely live well

10
00:00:26,550 --> 00:00:27,910
Let you eat a full banquet

11
00:00:30,360 --> 00:00:31,880
Born to the second seat before the day after tomorrow

12
00:00:31,880 --> 00:00:33,720
Is this what it feels like to be taken care of by a boss?

13
00:00:34,660 --> 00:00:36,620
